<title>THAILAND: ICC Inter 1996 net profit falls 15.8 pct.</title>
<headline>ICC Inter 1996 net profit falls 15.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		23.39     vs	   53.76</p>
<p>    Net			665.67     vs	  790.56</p>
<p>NOTES: Revs not stated. Full name of the cosmetic producer is ICC International Plc. Its 1996 net profit was based on 28.46 million shares against 14.71 million for 1995.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-252-9950-3</p>
</text>
